OL,3,GNEWSAI've only sold five copies of GTA 
OL,4,A6, says shop owner                     
OL,6,FThe owner of an independent game shop  
OL,7,Fsays he has only sold five copies of   
OL,8,Fthe highly anticipated open-world      
OL,9,Faction-adventure Grand Theft Auto 6.   
OL,11,FGTA 6, as it is known, is estimated to 
OL,12,Fbecome the biggest entertainment launch
OL,13,Fin history following the blockbuster   
OL,14,Fvideo game's debut on Thursday, after a
OL,15,F13-year wait.                          
OL,17,FBut Richard Tewksbury, who runs Super  
OL,18,FGame Shack in the Silver Arcade in     
OL,19,FLeicester, said he had seen            
OL,20,F"embarrassing" sales of the game       
OL,21,Fbecause it was only released as a      
OL,22,Fdigital download and not on disc.      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
