OL,3,GNEWSAI've only sold five copies of GTA 
OL,4,A6, says shop owner                     
OL,6,F"People are super, super, super hungry 
OL,7,Ffor this game - so it's already doing  
OL,8,Fcrazy numbers already - but that's not 
OL,9,Ftranslated for us," he said.           
